---
description: Vue 3 SPA and chat UI conventions
globs: ["frontend/**/*.{vue,ts,js}"]
alwaysApply: false
---
- Vue 3 Composition API + <script setup lang="ts">, Pinia for state. Stack per ADR-0004.
- Use design tokens; no hard-coded colours/spacing. Support dark mode and keyboard navigation.
- Tool results render as cards (LoadCard, CarrierCard, RateTable, Timeline, ConfirmCard).
  Reuse existing cards before creating new ones.
- Write actions from chat always show ConfirmCard (preview → Confirm/Edit/Cancel).
- Realtime via Frappe socket.io events; handle reconnect and streaming partial messages.
- Every screen has an empty state, loading state and error state.
